# Live-shell orchestrator config — copy to `.mini-ork/orchestrator.yaml`.
#
# One orchestrator per project, backed by a long-lived tmux session that the
# UI's Live shell attaches to. This file picks which harness that session runs.
# It is read by the opt-in PTY bridge (`MO_PTY_ENABLED=1`); the file itself is
# local to the project (gitignored under .mini-ork/).
#
# Resolution precedence (highest first):
#   1. explicit `cmd` from the Live-shell UI toggle
#   2. this file's `harness:` key
#   3. the MO_ORCHESTRATOR environment variable
#   4. the built-in default: opencode
#
# Allowed harnesses: opencode | codex | claude | shell
harness: opencode
